{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在部分心理因果的交代上不如 X，尤其 S08 对未来不确定的铺垫、S13 对永远无法保证的认识，X 说得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点词有明显层级，感受文字又能跟着音乐分段出现，观众可以先抓住人物此刻的心情，再留意具体的音乐和身体感受，不必在密集文字里同时寻找重点。水、船、摇荡、漂浮到最后停住的意象反复呼应，也让前后形成一条连贯的情绪线，感受比 X 更具体细腻。不过 X 的叙述保留了更多心理转折的来由，人物为什么犹豫、为什么担心，交代得更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9e7b5717-7f2a-49df-9fa6-844eff212876", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T070924768949Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:11:13.719793+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a593112ce98376a42b13902997bd6a7f267c480c2433d2dc3928232d6fbe6f3b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen